{"id":"bewegung","lemma":"Bewegung","pos":"noun","rank":654,"glosses":["motion","move (step made in the execution of a plan or goal; a change in strategy)","movement"],"ipa":"/bəˈveːɡʊŋ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d3/De-Bewegung.ogg/De-Bewegung.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Bewegung","plural":"Bewegungen"},"examples":[{"text":"Wir sollten in Bewegung bleiben.","en":"We should keep moving.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/755745","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"should","l":"sollen"},{"g":"in"},null,{"g":"to remain"}]},{"text":"Er war der Anführer der Bewegung.","en":"He was the leader of the movement.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"leader"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Mach keine brüsken Bewegungen.","en":"Don't make abrupt moves.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/759743","words":[{"g":"to make","l":"machen"},{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},null,null]},{"text":"Bewegung ist gut für die Gesundheit.","en":"Exercise is good for your health.","words":[null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"good"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"health"}]},{"text":"Etwas Bewegung wird dir gut tun.","en":"Moderate exercise will do you good.","words":[{"g":"something"},null,{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"du"},{"g":"good"},{"g":"to do"}]}]}